## State

Run state is persisted in artifacts under the run workdir. Only `booping transition` writes it — never hand-edit an artifact's `status`.

Read the whole run's frontier before starting or resuming:

```
booping state <run workdir>/index.md --playbook fx-orphan-state
```

### State: main

- Referenced by: outer graph
- Artifact: `index.md` (relative to the run workdir)
- Initial status: `start`
- Advance: `booping transition <run workdir>/index.md <to> --playbook fx-orphan-state`

| Status | To | When | Gates |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `start` | `done` | a returned | — |
| `done` | *(terminal)* | — | — |

### State: stray

- Referenced by: nothing
- Artifact: `stray.md` (relative to the run workdir)
- Initial status: `x`
- Advance: `booping transition <run workdir>/stray.md <to> --playbook fx-orphan-state --state stray`

| Status | To | When | Gates |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `x` | *(terminal)* | — | — |

